WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:08.804
Get out.

00:00:08.804 --> 00:00:09.693
[PLEASE STOP HURTING KEY.]

00:00:09.693 --> 00:00:10.604
Get out.
[PLEASE STOP HURTING KEY.]

00:00:10.604 --> 00:00:11.110
[PLEASE STOP HURTING KEY.]

00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:15.869
I told you to get out! Get out.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.097
Get out.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.830
[SHE’S BLEEDING.]

00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:22.331
Stop it.

00:00:22.619 --> 00:00:23.623
-Stop it.
-Get out.

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:24.303
Stop it.

00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:26.431
Tell her to stop.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.431
[REHEARSAL BEFORE THE SHOOTING.]

00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:28.097
Get out.
[REHEARSAL BEFORE THE SHOOTING.]

00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:28.136
[REHEARSAL BEFORE THE SHOOTING.]

00:00:28.136 --> 00:00:29.431
What’s wrong with you?
[REHEARSAL BEFORE THE SHOOTING.]

00:00:29.431 --> 00:00:29.590
[REHEARSAL BEFORE THE SHOOTING.]

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:31.296
-Stop it.
-Get out!

00:00:31.961 --> 00:00:33.317
Don’t touch me!

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.591
Stop it.

00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:35.798
-No.
-Stop it.

00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:37.400
She’s your daughter.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.598
I think you should sit down.
[THE DIRECTOR IS BRIEFING THE ACTRESSES.]

00:00:39.598 --> 00:00:39.900
[THE DIRECTOR IS BRIEFING THE ACTRESSES.]

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:47.499
I mean, when she hits your head,
you should sink to the floor.

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:53.137
If you are already in a sitting position
when your mom throws it at you,

00:00:53.165 --> 00:00:54.109
you don’t need to stand up.

00:01:05.223 --> 00:01:06.100
Come here.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.280
[PEACH IS HOLDING AND COMFORTING KEY.]

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.801
It’s okay. I’m right here.
[PEACH IS HOLDING AND COMFORTING KEY.]

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.190
[PEACH IS HOLDING AND COMFORTING KEY.]

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.296
Can you spray mosquito repellent on me?

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.470
[SHE IS POPULAR AMONG MOSQUITOES.]

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.250
[KEY AND BIG MOM ARE SO CUTE.]

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:35.734
(Cut.)

00:01:38.179 --> 00:01:39.922
(Walk in and say your lines.)

00:01:39.952 --> 00:01:40.696
Yes.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.051
Why are you leaving so soon?

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:44.497
Can’t you stay a bit longer?

00:01:51.914 --> 00:01:54.348
Take care. Ride safely.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.550
[READY TO TAKE OFF.]

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.250
[THE DIRECTOR SHOWS HER HOW TO RIDE.]

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.838
[LET’S GO.]

00:02:07.869 --> 00:02:10.032
(That’s good. Cut.)

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.590
[THIS IS SO KEY!]

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.410
[WHAT’S GOING ON HERE?]

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.198
Right.

00:02:26.408 --> 00:02:30.297
You came back to fight for her.

00:02:30.327 --> 00:02:30.829
Yes.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.210
[I CAN’T HOLD IT ANYMORE.]

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.210
[LOVE, LOVE.]

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.750
[THEY HAVE THEIR OWN DANCING MOVES.]

00:02:46.485 --> 00:02:47.998
It won’t look good.

00:02:48.748 --> 00:02:50.200
It won’t look good.

00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:50.899
What?

00:02:50.915 --> 00:02:52.870
[HUH?]

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.150
[JAY IS MAD!]

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.548
Emi, Bonnie, Filmie, Jamie, and Rainy.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.296
(Cut.)

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.890
[KEY’S MOUTH IS FULL OF FOOD.]

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:18.010
[CHAN’S DAILY STRENGTH SOURCE.]

00:03:23.687 --> 00:03:24.400
(Cut.)

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.710
[THE HEARTBEAT SOUND IS LOUD.
THIS IS NOT JUST ACTING FOR SOMEONE.]

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:33.630
[LITTLE JAY LOOKS SO SHINING.]

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:43.897
For me?

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:47.207
Or for yourself?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.450
[SIMBA AND HIS MAMA.]

00:03:58.240 --> 00:03:58.760
[TAKE THE CHANCE TO HOLD HER.]

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.198
Chan, I’m just kidding.
[TAKE THE CHANCE TO HOLD HER.]

00:04:01.198 --> 00:04:01.550
[TAKE THE CHANCE TO HOLD HER.]

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.500
Didn’t you say
you’re not good at making up?

00:04:05.361 --> 00:04:06.303
Yes.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.000
Who taught you these lines?

00:04:11.567 --> 00:04:13.302
I just can’t help it.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.790
[LOOK AT HER HIPS.
PLEASE DON’T LEAVE HER.]

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.404
(Cut.)

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:23.525
[IT LOOKS TASTY BUT IT’S ACTUALLY CHEWY.]

00:04:23.525 --> 00:04:24.810
It’s really chewy.
[IT LOOKS TASTY BUT IT’S ACTUALLY CHEWY.]

00:04:25.908 --> 00:04:26.902
Are you shooting a video?

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:27.847
(Yes.)

00:04:32.297 --> 00:04:33.383
(Cut.)

00:04:33.413 --> 00:04:36.831
Where are you putting your hand?
[P’CHAN, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?]

00:04:37.078 --> 00:04:38.500
You want her to remember you.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.248
No matter what happens in your life,
you live to meet her again.

00:04:49.008 --> 00:04:51.245
You are mad.

00:04:52.561 --> 00:04:54.951
You are very angry at her.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.949
Whatever her reason was,
it didn’t hold water.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.350
[JAY FEELS HOT.]

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.400
I have some savings.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:12.082
-I skipped my line, didn’t I?
-Yes.

00:05:12.115 --> 00:05:13.404
-I’m sorry.
-It’s okay.

00:05:13.423 --> 00:05:14.921
It’ll make us stronger.

00:05:14.954 --> 00:05:15.937
Stronger.

00:05:16.183 --> 00:05:18.552
What would I do if I’m arrested, Jay?

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:20.931
I can’t let
our family’s reputation be ruined.

00:05:21.136 --> 00:05:22.496
Calm down, Aunt.

00:05:22.537 --> 00:05:23.930
We will work it out.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.724
Work it out?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.770
[IT’S AN EMOTIONAL SCENE FOR JAY.]

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.030
[HOLD TO COMFORT LITTLE JAY.]

00:05:38.048 --> 00:05:39.001
Key runs away.

00:05:39.031 --> 00:05:41.564
Chan is about to follow her,
but Jay holds her back.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:45.130
[THE EXES ARE TALKING THINGS OUT.]

00:05:46.428 --> 00:05:47.801
I told you.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.500
The first kiss is like
smoking a cigarette.

00:05:54.585 --> 00:05:56.583
You get excited only the first time.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.850
[SHE’S GETTING INTO HER CHARACTER.]

00:06:03.725 --> 00:06:05.945
Jay tries to kiss her.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.310
[SHE SEES IT WITH HER OWN EYES.]

00:06:13.925 --> 00:06:14.964
No.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.370
[SHE FEELS DOWN FOR REAL.]

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:35.710
[KEY IS SAD.
CHAN NEEDS TO MAKE UP WITH HER.]

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.730
[CHAN IS HERE.]

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.930
[THEY HOLD HANDS TO SUPPORT EACH OTHER.]

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:04.270
[THEY HAVE WORKED THINGS OUT.]

